,\"contentSummary\":\"逆光人像：窗边自然光中的市场观察。汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益。 本文以窗边自然光为背景，按准备、观察、分析和复查四部分组织材料。案例只描述当前场景，不承诺适用于全部情况；读者需要核对自身条件再判断是否采用。\",\"contentTruncated\":false,\"evidenceCompleteness\":\"full\",\"matchedInterestIds\":[\"evaluation:interest:photo\"],\"interestMatches\":[{\"interestId\":\"evaluation:interest:photo\",\"relevance\":\"direct\",\"matchReason\":\"Authored direct association with photo.\"}]}]</candidates>\n  <recent_recommendations>[]</recent_recommendations>\n</recommendation_material>","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me analyze this task.\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct Candidates from the exposed working set (120 candidates), order them, and publish them as one Recommendation collection.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods), 成像原理 (imaging principles), 不同条件下的调整 (adjustments under different conditions), NOT 器材促销 (equipment promotions) or 摄影师私生活 (photographers' private lives).\n\nThe preferences list is empty. There's no explicit reaction history or recent recommendations.\n\nLet me look at the candidates. All candidates match the photo interest. They have titles like \"静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察\" (still life lighting: market observation in low-light indoor), etc.\n\nThe content types seem to be one of several kinds based on their descriptions:\n1. \"市场观察\" (market observation) - summarizes camera purchase bundles, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is 器材促销/促销内容, which the user explicitly does NOT want.\n2. \"专题观察\" (thematic observation) - records photography exhibition curatorial clues, author biographies, artwork history - focuses on art activity history and viewing experience. This could be considered 摄影师背景/展览历史 content, which is also somewhat off from \"实际拍摄方法、成像原理\" but not necessarily forbidden. Actually the user says they don't follow \"器材促销或摄影师私生活\" (equipment promotion or photographers' private lives). Exhibition curatorial content is more art history, not exactly private lives. But it's not shooting methods either.\n3. \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - explains image differences from light, imaging and visual relations, explains variable effects, applicable conditions, analyzes when common intuitions fail. This matches \"成像原理\" and \"实际拍摄方法\" well.\n4. \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - lists common concepts, briefly explains phenomena, provides a question catalog for further reading. This is educational/learning content, matches well.\n5. \"操作记录\" (operation records) - fixes composition and light, changes shooting parameters one at a time, records corresponding images, compares highlights, shadows, subject detail, adjusts settings. This matches \"实际拍摄方法\" well.\n\nSo the candidates fall into categories:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles)\n- 操作记录 (operation records)\n- 专题观察 (thematic observation/exhibition)\n- 市场观察 (market observation)\n\nGiven the interest description: \"摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\" This translates to: Photography learning, focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions; NOT interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives.\n\nSo we should:\n- Favor: 条件与原理 (conditions & principles), 操作记录 (operation records), 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- Exclude: 市场观察 (market observation = equipment promotions), 专题观察 (thematic observation = exhibition curators, author biographies — could be \"photographers' private lives\"-ish or at least not about shooting methods/principles)\n\nThe 专题观察 content: \"记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验。\" - This records curatorial clues, author's life (作者生平) and artwork circulation, focusing on art activities' historical background and viewing experience. The user doesn't want \"摄影师私生活\" (photographers' private lives). 作者生平 could be considered artist biography which borders on private life. It's not really about shooting methods or imaging principles. So exclude these too.\n\nSo the eligible candidates for selection are those with \"条件与原理\", \"操作记录\", \"概念速览\" content types.\n\nAlso note: there is a \"resume\" pattern in the URL. The title says \"静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察\" — wait, the pattern is \"<topic>：<condition>中的<category>\". Hmm, but actually looking more carefully, titles may not match the description category. Let me check each.\n\nActually the title is like \"静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察\". And the description confirms it's 市场观察 type. Let me consider topic variety too: topics include 静物布光 (still life lighting), 运动追焦 (motion tracking), 逆光人像 (backlit portrait), 雨天反光 (rain reflection), 夜景曝光 (night exposure), 室内白平衡 (indoor white balance), 微距景深 (macro depth of field), 街头构图 (street composition), 风光滤镜 (landscape filter), 儿童抓拍 (children candid shots).\n\nConditions: 低照度室内 (low-light indoor), 窗边自然光 (window natural light), 黄昏户外 (dusk outdoor), 阴天街道 (overcast street).\n\nThe working set has 120 candidates. We need to pick 20 with the best quality content relative to the user's interest. But no actual recommendations/reactions exist (recent_recommendations empty). Given all candidates are authored to be photo-related, but we should prefer those that align with the explicit interest requirements (shooting method, imaging principle, adjustments) and avoid market observation and exhibition/thematic observation.\n\nWait — but candidate facts are limited. We have descriptions available. The descriptions are sufficient to categorize. Some candidates are e.g., \"夜景曝光：阴天街道中的概念速览\" etc.\n\nLet me think about what constitutes the \"quality\" set here. Since the task says \"Select exactly execution.actualTarget (20) distinct Candidates from the exposed working set\" and to make a balanced collection across interests, sources, content types.\n\nGiven one interest (photo) and one source (Open Web), balance across content types matters: prefer concept overviews, conditions & principles, and operation records — the three learning-oriented types — over exhibition observations and market observations.\n\nLet me count the categories within the working set to make sure we have enough suitable choices. The working set count is 120, and all 120 are exposed. Let me identify which candidates are \"good\" (概念速览, 条件与原理, 操作记录) versus \"bad\" (市场观察, 专题观察).\n\nActually wait. Let me reconsider whether 专题观察 should be excluded. The interest says: \"不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活\" — not concerned with equipment promotions or photographers' private lives. 专题观察 records \"摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验\" — that's exhibition/art history type. It contains 作者生平 (author's life story). Is 作者生平 = 摄影师私生活? Not exactly, but it's biographical. It's a stretch. The user's interest focuses on 实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整. The 专题观察 content about exhibition curation and art history is arguably relevant to photography learning in a cultural sense but isn't about shooting methods or imaging principles. Given the user explicitly narrows to method/principles, and the candidates offer plenty of directly matching ones, I'll prefer the directly matching types and exclude the 专题观察 and 市场观察.\n\nLet me enumerate all good candidates by scanning for type keywords in description:\n- \"条件与原理\" → direct match (成像原理, 方法适用条件, 直觉失效分析)\n- \"操作记录\" → direct match (实际拍摄操作, 逐次改变参数记录画面)\n- \"概念速览\" → learning concepts\n\nThese three categories align with \"实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整\". 概念速览 is a primer of concepts, aligned with 学习.\n\nLet me go through each candidate and classify by its description:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d: 静物布光...市场观察 → EXCLUDE (market)\n2. item-03a565217024: 运动追焦...专题观察 → EXCLUDE (exhibition)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f: 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e: 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247: 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3: 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d: 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b: 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0: 微距景深：黄昏户外