3203a\n62. 8e6664049202\n63. 96d00b2bdc7b\n64. 9748a6b84d7b\n65. 9df219efa583\n66. a0670ce803ad\n67. a083320d3f83\n\nSo there are 67 \"include\" candidates (learning-focused). We need 20 of them. Great, plenty.\n\nNow we should select 20 that are well-balanced across topics and conditions, and content types. But actually, given that candidates themselves have a pattern, the quality difference is somewhat synthetic. The ranking likely encodes quality. Hmm. But without additional signals, we should present balanced content types.\n\nWait, but is the candidate order meaningful? The candidates appear to be in some order. Perhaps the \"deterministic segment of frozen ranking\" is the full list. All are shown (working set count 120, all exposed, actualTarget 20).\n\nThe typical approach for these evaluation tasks: choose the best candidates that match interest. Given the interest is specific about not wanting market/equipment promotion and photographer personal life content, the strongest signal is to exclude 市场观察 and 专题观察 content, and include 概念速览/条件与原理/操作记录 content.\n\nWhich type is highest quality relative to \"关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整\"?\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles): directly addresses 成像原理 and 不同条件下的调整 (variables and applicable conditions, and when intuitions fail). Very aligned.\n- 操作记录 (operation records): directly addresses 实际拍摄方法 (fix composition and light, change parameters, compare highlight/shadow/subject detail). Very aligned.\n- 概念速览 (concept overview): addresses 摄影学习 - lists concepts and provides a reading list. Aligned as learning entry.\n\nFor a balanced collection, we can include all three types across topics.\n\nLet me define the topic-to-condition mapping present among the include candidates. Topics: 静物布光, 运动追焦, 逆光人像, 雨天反光, 夜景曝光, 室内白平衡, 微距景深, 街头构图, 风光滤镜, 儿童抓拍 (10 topics). Conditions: 低照度室内, 窗边自然光, 黄昏户外, 阴天街道 (4 conditions).\n\nAmong includes we have quite even distribution. Let me count includes by topic:\n- 静物布光: 2272238187d9 (阴天街道概念), 258cf26f5a9