ch condition used in the 20 would ideally be ~5 each, but not strictly necessary.\n\nLet me count content types after final set:\n\nItem list (20):\n1. item-305dca4b57c4 静物布光/低照度室内/条件原理\n2. item-734464ef3a3b 静物布光/窗边自然光/操作记录\n3. item-3c7c2f99c9b1 运动追焦/窗边自然光/操作记录\n4. item-4a3715896d61 运动追焦/阴天街道/概念速览\n5. item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像/黄昏户外/条件原理\n6. item-7bf9105e6b5b 逆光人像/低照度室内/概念速览\n7. item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光/窗边自然光/操作记录\n8. item-6602f232e957 雨天反光/黄昏户外/条件原理\n9. item-0ca34ef0a880 夜景曝光/阴天街道/概念速览\n10. item-a083320d3f83 夜景曝光/黄昏户外/操作记录\n11. item-5483802ef951 室内白平衡/窗边自然光/条件原理\n12. item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡/阴天街道/操作记录\n13. item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深/黄昏户外/条件原理\n14. item-9748a6b84d7b 微距景深/窗边自然光/概念速览\n15. item-9df219efa583 街头构图/窗边自然光/条件原理\n16. item-68a3d6c10d1d 街头构图/低照度室内/操作记录\n17. item-1b824b8d4dec 风光滤镜/低照度室内/概念速览\n18. item-38f75ee3d0a0 风光滤镜/阴天街道/操作记录\n19. item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍/黄昏户外/条件原理\n20. item-3fc285db25a7 儿童抓拍/黄昏户外/概念速览\n\nCounts:\n- 条件与原理: 1,5,8,11,13,15,19 = 7\n- 操作记录: 2,3,7,10,12,16,18 = 7\n- 概念速览: 4,6,9,14,17,20 = 6\nBalanced 7/7/6. \n\nConditions: 低照度室内(1,6,16,17)=4; 窗边自然光(2,3,7,11,14,15)=6; 黄昏户外(5,8,10,13,19,20)=6; 阴天街道(4,9,12,18)=4. Reasonably spread.\n\nThis is a decent set of 20. Now what order for presentation? We might order them by content-type progression or by topic. Given that the user's interest describes photography learning, we could order by content type learning path: 概念速览 first as entry, then 条件与原理, then 操作记录 for practice. But grouping by content type might present uniform sections. Alternatively, present the strongest matches first: articles covering both method & principle across distinct situations.\n\nActually there is no defined top candidate. Ordering probably not heavily constrained; but do we want the best first? Let's order by relevance to the interest description. Hmm.\n\nActually, let me think about what could be considered \"highest value\" to this user: \n- The user wants to learn actual shooting methods, imaging principles, adjustments under different co